<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the final day of four-day Red Stripe Cup cricket matches on Monday:</p>
<p>In Bridgetown: Jamaica beat Barbados by 8 wickets. Barbados 258 and 180 (P.Wallace 53; C.Walsh 6-39). Jamaica 282 and 157-2 (R.Sammuels 90 not out, J.Adams 50 not out).</p>
<p>In St George's, Grenada: Guyana drew with the Windward Islands. Windward Islands 446 and 177-9 declared (J.Sylvester 54; R.King 5-43, M.Nagamootoo 4-67). Guyana 315 and 125-8 (T.Dowlin 30; M.Morgan 3-42).</p>
</text>
